{"version":1,"content":"<p>近日又見到不少關於泰國空氣污染的新聞，甚麼PM2.5、空氣質素指數、霧霾警告，搞到部分準備來泰國旅遊的朋友開始擔心，究竟現在曼谷的空氣是否真的那麼差？</p><p>甚至有人考慮是否應該取消行程。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;其實，我覺得大家真的毋須過分緊張。</p><p>&amp;l</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T09:23:57.877702+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":117,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T09:00:43+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T09:17:15.558510+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T09:17:15.558510+00:00","content_hash":"a8f5d3786ad98da5fda7fc9e814c07beea53e506420f9e5799abacb521465f61","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}